            "title": "Main Specs & Dimensions",
            "content": "<ul><li><strong>375 Lbs</strong> Weight Capacity</li><li>Running Area Size：<strong>18×43.5</strong> in</li><li>Can Be Stored <strong>Vertically</strong> After Folded</li><li>Speed of 0.6-8.6mph(Adjustable)</li><li>0-5% Incline</li><li>Net Weight：38.4 Kg/84.7Lbs. If you can lift 33 LBS(15Kg) moving the treadmill will be a breeze.</li><li>Comes <strong>98% Pre-assembled</strong></li><li>Heart Rate Monitor</li><li><strong>Free App</strong> Subscription</li><li><strong>12</strong> Preset Programs</li><li><strong>3-Year</strong> Warranty</li><li><strong>30-Day</strong> Risk Free Trial</li><li>AI Voice Control | Console Control | 3D VR</li><li>Built-in Bluetooth Music Player</li><li>Product Folded Size: 55.24 x 26.5 x 4.96 in</li></ul><p></p>",
